          }
        },
        "block_1_6X4eXk": {
          "type": "block_1",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sustainability",
            "content": "<p>Learn more about sustainability <a href=\"/pages/sustainability\" title=\"Sustainability\">here</a>.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dEtQXW": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is ShadeDrops Mineral Milk Sunscreen vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Summer Fridays products are not tested on animals or contain any animal by-products.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_wipdLf": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is ShadeDrops Mineral Milk Sunscreen gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>ShadeDrops Broad Spectrum SPF 30 Mineral Milk Sunscreen is formulated without gluten. It’s important to note that while all Summer Fridays products are formulated to be gluten-free, we cannot guarantee that they have been produced in a gluten-free facility. However, The National Celiac Association has stated that unless cosmetic products are ingested, there should not be an issue with gluten in topical products. </p><p>Please see <a href=\"https://nationalceliac.org/celiac-disease-questions/using-gluten-free-skin-body-products-someone-celiac-disease/\">here</a> for additional information. As always, if there is concern, we recommend that you consult with your physician/healthcare provider prior to use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_PFnEJE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is ShadeDrops Mineral Milk Sunscreen non-comedogenic?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, ShadeDrops Broad Spectrum SPF 30 Mineral Milk Sunscreen is non-comedogenic, which means it will not clog pores.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_xY79XQ": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is ShadeDrops Mineral Milk Sunscreen suitable for all skin types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, ShadeDrops Broad Spectrum SPF 30 Mineral Milk Sunscreen is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dnfwT7": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is ShadeDrops Mineral Milk Sunscreen fragrance-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, ShadeDrops Broad Spectrum SPF 30 Mineral Milk Sunscreen is formulated without fragrance.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_ThJAdE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes ShadeDrops Mineral Milk Sunscreen different from a chemical sunscreen?",
            "content": "<p>The difference between mineral sunscreens and chemical sunscreens is how they work on the skin. Mineral sunscreens reflect the sun’s rays while chemical sunscreens absorb the sun’s rays so that they don’t penetrate the skin.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_6VLT8F": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How often should I reapply ShadeDrops Mineral Milk Sunscreen?",
            "content": "<p>We recommend reapplying every 2 hours, 15 minutes before sun exposure.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_mHJhYa": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does ShadeDrops Mineral Milk Sunscreen work underneath make-up?",
            "content": "<p>We recommend applying ShadeDrops Broad Spectrum SPF 30 Mineral Milk Sunscreen as the last step in your skin care routine, before primer.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        }
      },
